  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Payce Digital - Senior Loan Supporting Financial Inclusion in Barbados</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project consists of a senior loan for up to BBD$10 million toCave Shepherd Card (Barbados) Inc. (&#x201c;CSCBI&#x201d; or &#x201c;Payce Digital&#x201d;), equivalent to approximately US$5 million and for up to five years, to promote financial inclusion in Barbados.The use of funds will support CSCBI&#x2019;s focus on providing access to credit facilities for persons who are traditionally under-banked. As a non-deposit taking institution, CSCBI relies primarily on wholesale funding to support its lending operations.</narrative>
  </description>
